          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies dysuria, haematuria, flank pain, fevers, rigors, nausea, vomiting, and loin pain. Stream is okay; denies hesitancy, sensation of incomplete emptying, visible lower abdominal swelling, and leakage between voids."
